  <NAME>Homo sapiens</NAME>
  <TITLE>Embryonic signature distinguishes pediatric and adult rhabdoid tumors from other SMARCB1-deficient cancers</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>We used microarrays to compare gene expression profilings in various SMARCB1-deficient tumors. Overall design: [human mRNA] 16 RT, 16 SD-NRT (8 Epithelioid Sarcomas, 3 Undifferentiated Chordomas and 5 Renal Medullary Carcinomas), 37 SMARCB1 deficient tumors.</DESCRIPTION>
